# --- LLM Semantic Extraction ---
# Supported providers: groq | gemini | ollama | custom
#
# Fallback chain (auto-detected when LLM_PROVIDER is not set):
#   If GROQ_API_KEY is set  → Groq is tried first (FREE, fast)
#   If GEMINI_API_KEY is set → Gemini is tried next (FREE fallback)
#   If both absent           → 100% deterministic extraction (always works)
